<title>UK: London gold touch firmer, silver eyes upside.</title>
<headline>London gold touch firmer, silver eyes upside.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixes firmer at $381.50 vs $380.80 AM and $381.00 on Tuesday PM. Looking to silver for direction.</p>
<p>SILVER - Up three cents at $5.05/$5.07, may probe a bit higher. Resistance seen around $5.09-$5.10.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Down 25 cents at $384.75/$385.75, but off lows.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Unchanged at $116.00/$117.00.</p>
</text>
